// look the procedural palettes were tuned against. roughnessMap/data textures
// stay linear. DELIBERATELY EXCLUDED (untestable / would shift more than albedo):
// the terrain+biome textures (custom shader uniform uDetailMap), the PMREM
// environment source, and the imposter render-target readback.
//   true  = corrected sRGB (default)
