  // UnrealBloomPass(resolution, strength, radius, threshold).
  // Strength 0.55 is conservative — only bright HDR-ish pixels bloom, so dark space stays
  // dark and bright Tron lines + planet rims get the glow. Previous 1.4 with audio bonus
