// What was actually wrong: the plot rectangle was clamped to 60x60 units, so
// however far you walked between posts you always got the same cottage. And
// nothing quantised the corners, so no two builds ever shared a plane.
//
// Now: corners SNAP to a uniform world grid (so every structure on a planet
