// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// TACTILE.MD §3.1 — AUDIO-REACTIVE ENVIRONMENTAL SHADERS
// Sub-Bass (20-120Hz) drives structural emissive intensity.
// High-Treble (4kHz-10kHz) drives terrain normalScale for fine micro-detail
