// fix404: TRULY TOROIDAL PLANETS. fix403 made the world loop, but with a
// MIRROR wrap — past the fold the terrain was a reflection of itself. A real
// torus repeats, it does not reflect: drive a full lap and you cross the SAME
// ground in the SAME order, having gone all the way around. That needs the
// noise to be periodic, which the generator is not. Rather than rewrite the
