// ═══ da012: CLIFF SCAN ════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// Josh asked for a way to scan cliffs. Walk a ray out along your sightline,
// sample the ground under it, and report the biggest vertical FACE it crosses
// with the grade and the run it happens over. Heights come back in metres as
// well as units, because "213 m, 71 degrees" means something and "38 units"
// does not. Also names the launch verdict, since the reason you are eyeing a
