// then climbs back to a second mouth. Architecture decisions:
//   • The cave NEVER touches surfaceHeightAt or the terrain mesh — it is a
//     separate interior mesh placed in world space below the ground, and the
//     walking integrator simply swaps its floor source while inside.
//   • Per-biome identity: TERRAN amber quartz, ICE glacial cyan, MYSTICAL
//     violet, TOXIC spore-green — and MAGMA caves are LAVA TUBES with ember
//     fog and molten floor glow (the magma under-map treatment lives here).
