  // fix756: SETTLE-WINDOW FAUNA CLAMP. Mirrors the flora clamp (fix755): for ~1.5s
  // after touchdown, pull the fauna draw radius in tight and ramp it out, so a herd
  // or flock doesn't all pop in at full range in the first frame (the same dip flora
