  // ── Find cliff edges for waterfall anchoring ───────────────────────────
  // Sample a grid of terrain points; where the gradient (slope) is very steep AND
  // the terrain is above water level, register a cliff candidate. Pick the SURF_WF_COUNT
  // best (steepest) candidates as waterfall attachment points.
