      // plus the multi-body safe-spawn pass.
      // at surface coordinates reinterpreted as space coordinates, stranding
      // you far from the planet. Now exit completion places you 2.4 radii
      // off the ACTUAL body you departed, facing outward — turn around and
      // the real planet (real material, real clouds) fills the view, exactly
