          // atmosphere only resolve from farther out, so up close it read as
          // "grown and styleless." Stand off ~13 radii (with a higher floor for
          // small worlds) so you leave looking at a whole planet, the way you
          // arrived. _exitStandoff overrides the multiplier if you want closer.
