      // arc the flight path — that "fighter jet leans into the turn" feel.
      // A/D = pure yaw (NMS-style flight). No banking — the previous "small
      // visual bank" still produced the "tilt and rise" feel users complained
      // about. Banking is now eliminated entirely from A/D. If you want roll,
